# Global Reference & Decisions Ledger

> **Purpose:** Single shared configuration, candidate preference source of truth, and centralized ledger of blocked questions discovered across the `career-autopilot` pipeline (`Phase 0`, `Phase 1`, `Phase 2`).  
> **Concurrency Rule (Up to 32 Workers):** Per-application workers read this file **read-only** and log any new blockers inside their own `applications/<company-slug>/application_state.md`. Only the parent coordinator merges answered questions and new blockers back into this file (`Section 4`) and `applications/tracker.md`.

---

